      <h2>A Note on Status</h2>
      <p>
        SDT is under active development. 15 of 24 benchmarks are certified, with 5 under investigation
        and 4 awaiting development. The theory is <strong>not yet peer-reviewed</strong>&mdash;this
        repository serves as open pre-publication review.
      </p>
      <p>
        We explicitly document what doesn't work yet. We want to find errors, not hide them.
        If you find a flaw, <a href="https://github.com/username/SDT/issues">please open an issue</a>.
      </p>

      <hr />

      <p class="text-center italic text-slate-500">
        "The universe is not quantum mechanical. Quantum mechanics is how the universe looks
        when you measure it with detectors larger than atoms."
      </p>
    </div>

